{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Overview:</strong><br><br>Ever wondered what it\u2019s like to be a farmer tycoon billionaire? Now you can!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Idle Farming Business, grow your farm from tiny plot to a multi zillionaire conglomerate farm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Plant seeds and harvest crops for coins. Grow different crops generate more coins. Upgrade crops to improve yield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Going offline? No worries, the farm works for YOU! Generate idle income while you are away, and come back to see how much you earned.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449640/extras/idle-farming-business-gif.gif?t=1744288164\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Beautiful farm themed graphics<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449640/extras/3.png?t=1744288164\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Activate rain and sunshine to boost your farm output<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449640/extras/5.png?t=1744288164\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Flip your farm and prestige by finding investors to acquire your farm<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449640/extras/1.png?t=1744288164\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Responsive gameplay that works on all device forms and sizes<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449640/extras/4.png?t=1744288164\" /></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3449640?t=1744288164","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3449640?t=1744288164","capsule_image":"https://shared